# Used instead of the root .dockerignore for supplier-service/Dockerfile (whose
# build context is the repository root). Same rules as the root file, plus
# TypeScript build caches: a host *.tsbuildinfo copied without its dist/ makes
# tsc skip emitting, so packages/contracts would build to nothing.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/coverage
**/.git
**/.gitignore
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/secrets
**/data
**/docs
**/*.secret
**/*.log
**/*.tsbuildinfo
